1
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:01,750
What?!

2
00:00:02,666 --> 00:00:03,875
He’s the Godfather?

3
00:00:04,625 --> 00:00:05,958
Governor, don’t listen to her!

4
00:00:06,291 --> 00:00:07,500
He’s a fraud!

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,000
The guards are here to arrest him,

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,500
and they’re still putting on this act!

7
00:00:12,083 --> 00:00:13,791
You do remember you came here to 

8
00:00:13,791 --> 00:00:15,625
congratulate the Godfather, right?

9
00:00:16,291 --> 00:00:17,083
So what?

10
00:00:18,041 --> 00:00:20,166
Do you really think the real Godfather

11
00:00:21,041 --> 00:00:23,833
would grovel and flatter someone like you?

12
00:00:24,958 --> 00:00:26,958
What the hell is going on here?

13
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:29,875
Who is the real Godfather?

14
00:00:31,125 --> 00:00:32,708
Maybe this will jog your memory.

15
00:00:34,208 --> 00:00:37,041
You… you’re Lady Cassia, the Judgment Knight?

16
00:00:38,041 --> 00:00:41,541
You begged repeatedly for an invitation to the Godfather’s wedding.

17
00:00:41,541 --> 00:00:42,958
To keep his identity hidden,

18
00:00:43,791 --> 00:00:47,500
I specifically told you to address him as "Mr. Carter".

19
00:00:48,583 --> 00:00:49,000
 Remember?

20
00:00:49,291 --> 00:00:51,333
Yes… yes, of course.

21
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:52,708
Now tell me.

22
00:00:53,083 --> 00:00:55,291
Who do you think the real Godfather is?

23
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:57,541
Godfather!

24
00:00:58,166 --> 00:00:59,916
Finally, someone with a brain.

25
00:01:00,791 --> 00:01:01,458
Get up.

26
00:01:02,541 --> 00:01:03,541
Thank you, Godfather!

27
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:09,916
This man called me a fraud and tried to arrest me.

28
00:01:10,125 --> 00:01:13,000
Governor, what do you think should be done with him?

29
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:13,333
What?!

30
00:01:13,833 --> 00:01:15,666
He dared try to arrest the Godfather?

31
00:01:16,333 --> 00:01:18,666
Strip him of his rank and throw him in the death cells!

32
00:01:21,041 --> 00:01:21,916
Governor, please!

33
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:23,708
I was only following orders!

34
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,125
I didn’t know anything!

35
00:01:26,291 --> 00:01:27,166
It was him!

36
00:01:27,416 --> 00:01:28,708
He’s the one who said it!

37
00:01:28,916 --> 00:01:30,041
You bastard!

38
00:01:30,625 --> 00:01:32,625
You dared slander the Godfather?

39
00:01:33,791 --> 00:01:34,708
No, Governor!

40
00:01:35,875 --> 00:01:37,041
He’s the impostor!

41
00:01:38,125 --> 00:01:39,791
No one here believes her!
